---
import { Aside } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';
---

<div class="pp-api-key-callout">
  <Aside type="note" title="API keys and environments">
    An API key looks like <code>pp_&#123;env&#125;_…</code>, and the environment name in the key
    decides where the render goes. <code>pp_sandbox_…</code> renders in the sandbox: documents carry
    a watermark, do not count toward your quota, and expire 30 days after creation.
    <code>pp_live_…</code> and the keys of environments you create on a Pro plan
    (<code>pp_&#123;name&#125;_…</code>) render without a watermark and count toward your quota.
    Every key targets the same API host.
  </Aside>
</div>
